  "content": {
    "rendered": "<p>Summer often brings changes to family routines, travel plans, and parenting schedules. It&#8217;s also a great time to review important family law matters and make sure your legal plans continue to reflect your family&#8217;s current needs. Our July newsletter highlights practical resources and timely legal information designed to help Colorado families navigate this season with confidence.</p>\n<h2>This Month&#8217;s Highlights</h2>\n<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"959\">Our July newsletter features a variety of topics, including:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"1733\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1uqb1i8\" data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"1162\"><a href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/financial-mistakes-before-filing-divorce-colorado/\"><strong data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"1034\">5 Financial Mistakes to Avoid Before Filing for Divorce in Colorado</strong></a> and why financial preparation can make a difference before beginning the divorce process.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1x53txi\" data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1340\"><strong data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1193\">Practice Area Spotlight:</strong> Divorce Planning &amp; Financial Preparation, with guidance on taking proactive steps before filing for divorce.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1yfrmoh\" data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1560\"><strong data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1357\"><a href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/marie-drake-named-a-two-time-colorado-titan-100-honoree/\">Firm News</a>:</strong> We&#8217;re proud to celebrate Marie Drake&#8217;s recognition as a <strong data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1449\">2026 Colorado Titan 100 Honoree</strong>, recognizing her leadership and dedication to serving Colorado families.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"mmoy5b\" data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1733\"><strong data-start=\"1563\" data-end=\"1597\">Summer Parenting FAQs and Tips</strong> covering travel, vacation schedules, communication, and parenting plans during the summer months.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Helping Colorado Families Stay Informed</h2>\n<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"1779\" data-end=\"2057\">At The Drake Law Firm, we believe that informed decisions begin with reliable information. Our monthly newsletter is one of the ways we share practical family law insights, firm updates, and resources that may help individuals and families better understand their legal options.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2246\">Whether you&#8217;re considering divorce, navigating child custody matters, or planning for the future, we&#8217;re committed to providing helpful information that supports you every step of the way.</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2246\">Questions About a Family Law Matter?</h2>\n<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"2289\" data-end=\"2436\">If you have questions about divorce, child custody, parenting plans, child support, or other family law issues, The Drake Law Firm is here to help.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"2438\" data-end=\"2542\"><strong data-start=\"2438\" data-end=\"2542\">Contact The Drake Law Firm today to schedule a consultation and learn more about your legal options.</strong></h3>\n"
  },
